570
00:37:52,465 --> 00:37:54,025
You really don’t know
how to manage your money.

571
00:38:08,505 --> 00:38:10,825
I reached Jessica
from the Weiyang store in 2003.

572
00:38:10,905 --> 00:38:13,105
