581
00:38:36,585 --> 00:38:37,745
<i>Here's the plan.</i>

582
00:38:37,825 --> 00:38:40,545
<i>We keep working both ends.</i>
<i>Once you're back in Weiyang,</i>

583
00:38:40,625 --> 00:38:42,025
