584
00:38:42,105 --> 00:38:43,465
Search the internal network.

585
00:38:43,545 --> 00:38:45,985
<i>I'll contact Xu Meng's family now.</i>

586
00:38:46,065 --> 00:38:49,265
We'll try to find this Yao Xingcheng
as soon as possible.

587
00:38:49,865 --> 00:38:51,345
-Okay.
-<i>Talk later.</i>

588
00:38:55,185 --> 00:38:56,985
Auntie Xu.

589
00:38:57,785 --> 00:38:59,025
Xu.

